# Design System Components (`src/components/`)

Consumer API. Compose from `ui/` + `@/lib/tokens`. Reference implementation: `src/components/combobox/`.

## File layout

| Shape | Path | When |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Simple | `src/components/<name>.tsx` | Single file, few props |
| Composite | `src/components/<name>/` | Multiple files, variants, field wrapper |

Composite folder (standard):

```text
components/<name>/
├── types.ts              # Shared item/value types
├── <name>-variants.ts    # CVA for product variants
├── <name>.tsx            # Core public component
├── <name>-field.tsx      # Optional: label + RHF (form controls only)
└── index.ts              # Barrel — re-export public surface
```

## Form controls (required contract)

Every input-like public component must support:

| Concern | API |
| --- | --- |
| Controlled | `value` + `onValueChange` / `onChange` |
| Uncontrolled | `defaultValue` |
| Form libraries | `forwardRef`, `onBlur`, `name`, `id` |
| Validation UI | `invalid` → `aria-invalid` + error border classes |
| Testing | `data-testid` on the focusable surface |
| Disabled | `disabled` |

**Popover / pickers:** fire blur when the overlay closes (selection or dismiss) so `mode: 'onBlur'` works.

Normalize empty form values: treat `''` and `null` like `undefined` for display when controlled.

## Field wrapper (`*Field`)

For components used in forms, add a sibling `*Field` (e.g. `ComboboxField`):

- Layout: `label`, `hint`, `errorMessage`, `required`, `containerClassName`
- Wire `id` + `htmlFor` via `@/ui/label`
- **Manual mode:** pass `value` / `onValueChange` / `invalid` / `errorMessage` directly
- **RHF mode:** pass `control` + `name` + optional `rules` → `useController` internally
- `react-hook-form` is an **optional** peer dependency (`peerDependenciesMeta.optional`)

Do **not** import RHF in the core component — only in `*-field.tsx`.

## Variants

- Product variants in `*-variants.ts` with CVA
- Map shared sizes to `SizeType` from `@/lib/tokens` when applicable
- Export `*Variants` + `VariantProps` for extension
- Map to semantic tokens — no hardcoded brand colors

## Composite components (Combobox, DatePicker, …)

- Build from `ui/` primitives (Popover + Command, etc.)
- Keep `ui/` free of composite / product logic
- Prefer shadcn **composition** over one mega-prop object
- Controlled state hook colocated in main file when small (`useControllableValue`)

## Export

Each public component → component + types (+ field + variants if exported) in `src/index.ts` only.

## Anti-patterns

| Avoid | Prefer |
| --- | --- |
| Uncontrolled-only controls | Controlled + uncontrolled |
| RHF inside core component | Separate `*Field` wrapper |
| Business logic in `ui/` | Wrappers in `components/` |
| Duplicate v1/v2 APIs | One namespace, extend variants |
